stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> TeamAControl
  TeamAControl --> TeamAControl: controlled action by A
  TeamAControl --> Contested: duel / pressure (no switch)
  Contested --> TeamAControl: A regains
  Contested --> TeamBControl: B gains control
  TeamAControl --> TeamBControl: B controlled action (switch)
